The port uses JavaScript double arithmetic on the same Float32 coordinates; the upstream Scalar implementation uses float. Actual seven-body, two-sided baseline/candidate comparisons against the pinned compiled C++ solver agree within 0.000103 mm. This is numerical-method agreement on native FBX topology, not evidence of exact SMPL landmarks or a garment fit certificate.
